window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Warm beds, quaint mysteries, and the best rosemary bread this side of Pigsend Creek. Welcome to the Weary Dragon Inn.</b></p> <p>Things are heating up in Pigsend, starting with mysterious magical events around the summer solstice and continuing through the annual Pigsend Harvest Festival. Get the final four books in the Weary Dragon Inn Series, including Zealots and Zeniths, Campaigns and Curses, Perils and Potions, and Royals and Ruses in a convenient bundle.<br> <br> The Weary Dragon Inn Series<br> <br> Ale and Amnesia (Newsletter Exclusive Prequel Novella)<br> 1. Drinks and Sinkholes<br> 2. Fiends and Festivals<br> 3. Secrets and Snowflakes<br> 4. Beasts and Baking<br> 5. Magic and Molemen<br> 6. Veils and Villains<br> 7. Zealots and Zeniths<br> 8. Campaigns and Curses<br> 9. Perils and Potions<br> 10. Royals and Ruses</p>"; 
